{
    "title": "Weather Forecast- Live Weather",
    "description": "<b>Weather Forecast</b> can be a weather channel or weather station on your personal device. If you are looking for an app for daily/hourly weather forecast, severe weather alerts or good looking weather widgets, <b>Weather forecast is THE APP</b> for you! \ud83d\udef0 \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udf2a\r\n \r\n== <b> Weather forecast features </b> ==\r\n\u2600<b>Weather Detail Lite</b>\r\nWith national weather forecast data, you can acknowledge every information you need to know about weather, \r\nincluding:\r\n- Weather forecast for local & global, all are free with hourly, daily update in real-time\r\n- Various weather information: temperature, wind, humidity, dew point, precipitation, visibility, pressure, sunrise & sunset, air quality\r\n- Customize unit setting: Temperature (\u2103/\u2109), Time format (12h/24h), Precipitation (mm, cm), wind speed (km/h, mi/h, m/s), visibility(miles, km), pressure (mb,inHg,mmHg, Pa)\r\n- Satellite image & Weather radar\r\n- Predict rainfall of the next 14 days\r\n- Daily Life Index\r\nThere is no weather information that Weather Forecast can't provide.\r\n \r\n\u26c5\ufe0f <b>72-hour Weather Forecast/14-day Weather Forecast</b>\r\nPlan your schedule up to 72 hours or 14 days with Weather Forecast, a successful man is always prepared. You can check unexpected weather data with this Weather Forecast app before you plan your outdoor activities and go out. Weather forecast updates weather information wherever you are, get your ambient weather dashboard in hand, control your daily life in hand.\r\n \r\n\u2602\ufe0f<b>Always Ready</b>\r\nYou can set the temperature to remind you of bringing a coat or set the rainfall probability to remind you of bringing an umbrella.\r\n \r\n\ud83c\udf2a <b>Severe weather alerts</b>\r\nWeather Forecast app can also turn into a global weather tracker and send you severe weather alerts to help you get prepared for upcoming weather changes, like stormy weather, heatwave, thunderstorm, heavy rainfall and so on. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f<b>Personal Weather Map</b>\r\nManage up to 10 cities' weather, care for yourself care for your loved ones, care for local weather and abroad. Showing in different weather information board.\r\n \r\n\ud83d\udcc8<b>Experience the Changes In Weather</b>\r\nShow hourly weather in graphs and daily weather in charts, see the changes in temperatures, rainfall probabilities and weather variations easily.\r\n \r\n\ud83c\udfa8<b>Weather - Your Daily Weather In a Flat Design</b>\r\nA simple black and white style in the homepage and notification bar, animated weather icon, and plenty of fine-designed widgets for your desktop. Night and day theme switching is available.\r\n  \r\nNo matter what occupation you are, <b>Weather Forecast</b> - Local&World is a free & simple weather forecast report that you can't miss. Get <b>Weather Forecast</b>, weather everywhere and become well-prepared and successful and get your sunny life.",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Weather Forecast</b> can be a weather channel or weather station on your personal device. If you are looking for an app for daily/hourly weather forecast, severe weather alerts or good looking weather widgets, <b>Weather forecast is THE APP</b> for you! \ud83d\udef0 \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udf2a<br> <br>== <b> Weather forecast features </b> ==<br>\u2600<b>Weather Detail Lite</b><br>With national weather forecast data, you can acknowledge every information you need to know about weather, <br>including:<br>- Weather forecast for local &amp; global, all are free with hourly, daily update in real-time<br>- Various weather information: temperature, wind, humidity, dew point, precipitation, visibility, pressure, sunrise &amp; sunset, air quality<br>- Customize unit setting: Temperature (\u2103/\u2109), Time format (12h/24h), Precipitation (mm, cm), wind speed (km/h, mi/h, m/s), visibility(miles, km), pressure (mb,inHg,mmHg, Pa)<br>- Satellite image &amp; Weather radar<br>- Predict rainfall of the next 14 days<br>- Daily Life Index<br>There is no weather information that Weather Forecast can&#39;t provide.<br> <br>\u26c5\ufe0f <b>72-hour Weather Forecast/14-day Weather Forecast</b><br>Plan your schedule up to 72 hours or 14 days with Weather Forecast, a successful man is always prepared. You can check unexpected weather data with this Weather Forecast app before you plan your outdoor activities and go out. Weather forecast updates weather information wherever you are, get your ambient weather dashboard in hand, control your daily life in hand.<br> <br>\u2602\ufe0f<b>Always Ready</b><br>You can set the temperature to remind you of bringing a coat or set the rainfall probability to remind you of bringing an umbrella.<br> <br>\ud83c\udf2a <b>Severe weather alerts</b><br>Weather Forecast app can also turn into a global weather tracker and send you severe weather alerts to help you get prepared for upcoming weather changes, like stormy weather, heatwave, thunderstorm, heavy rainfall and so on. <br><br>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f<b>Personal Weather Map</b><br>Manage up to 10 cities&#39; weather, care for yourself care for your loved ones, care for local weather and abroad. Showing in different weather information board.<br> <br>\ud83d\udcc8<b>Experience the Changes In Weather</b><br>Show hourly weather in graphs and daily weather in charts, see the changes in temperatures, rainfall probabilities and weather variations easily.<br> <br>\ud83c\udfa8<b>Weather - Your Daily Weather In a Flat Design</b><br>A simple black and white style in the homepage and notification bar, animated weather icon, and plenty of fine-designed widgets for your desktop. Night and day theme switching is available.<br>  <br>No matter what occupation you are, <b>Weather Forecast</b> - Local&amp;World is a free &amp; simple weather forecast report that you can&#39;t miss. Get <b>Weather Forecast</b>, weather everywhere and become well-prepared and successful and get your sunny life.",
